{"id":"aec648c6e1b28b3d","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-order2-rank-function.md","title":"ZFC Order2 Rank Function","display":"df-zfc-order2-rank-function — ZFC Order2 Rank Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order2-rank-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order2-rank-function"],"display":"df-zfc-order2-rank-function — ZFC Order2 Rank Function","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order2-rank-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order2-rank-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order2-rank-function — ZFC Order2 Rank Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,P,\\leq_P,x,y,\\beta\\in V\">\\(r,P,\\leq_P,x,y,\\beta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2RankFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2RankFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}rank\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2RankFunction}_S(r,P,\\leq_P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\exists\\beta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,P,\\beta)\n\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\left(r(x)=\\bigcup\\{r(y)\\cup\\{r(y)\\}\\mid y\\in P\\land y\\leq_Px\\land y\\neq x\\}\\right)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}rank\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2RankFunction}_S(r,P,\\leq_P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\exists\\beta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,P,\\beta)\n\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\left(r(x)=\\bigcup\\{r(y)\\cup\\{r(y)\\}\\mid y\\in P\\land y\\leq_Px\\land y\\neq x\\}\\right)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The value at each point is the supremum of the successors of all strict predecessors' ranks; a set ordinal bounds the range.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"r,P,\\leq_P,x,y,\\beta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2RankFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}rank\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2RankFunction}_S(r,P,\\leq_P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\exists\\beta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,P,\\beta)\n\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\left(r(x)=\\bigcup\\{r(y)\\cup\\{r(y)\\}\\mid y\\in P\\land y\\leq_Px\\land y\\neq x\\}\\right)\n\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1351,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2940","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-order2-rank-function.md|58-df-zfc-order2-rank-function]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9ee45afab4c00dd5","36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2"]}